{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-10-04 08:41:00', 'title': 'DTE ENERGY FOUNDATION SUPPORTS JOB READINESS, EDUCATION AND BASIC NEEDS IN WEST MICHIGAN COMMUNITIES', 'text': 'FUNDING WILL BOOST ACCESS TO JOBS, EDUCATION AND FOOD TO STRENGTHEN FAMILIES AND REDUCE INEQUITY FOR A STRONGER, BRIGHTER MICHIGAN. FUNDING WILL BOOST ACCESS TO JOBS, EDUCATION AND FOOD TO STRENGTHEN FAMILIES AND REDUCE INEQUITY FOR A STRONGER, BRIGHTER MICHIGAN.'}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-10-04 08:00:00', 'title': 'DTE ENERGY AND LOCAL COMMUNITIES MOVE FORWARD WITH FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND COMMUNITY SOLAR PROJECT IN WASHTENAW COUNTY', 'text': 'DETROIT, OCT. 04, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DTE ENERGY (NYSE: DTE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY IS MOVING FORWARD WITH A PLAN TO BUILD ITS FIRST MIGREENPOWER COMMUNITY SOLAR PROJECT IN WASHTENAW COUNTY. THE 20-MEGAWATT FACILITY WILL BE THE LARGEST IN THE REGION AND IS DESIGNED TO SUPPORT THE CITY OF ANN ARBOR AND PITTSFIELD TOWNSHIP WITH ACHIEVING THEIR CLEAN ENERGY GOALS. ADDITIONALLY, ALL DTE ELECTRIC CUSTOMERS WILL HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO SUBSCRIBE TO THIS PROJECT.'}